{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "aura_global_effect",
  "spec": ["aura 5.2", "aura 6.14", "aura 17.9"],
  "description": "globalEffect = the ordinance's cumulative offset for 0xAA5B8407 (Youth Curfew -10 + Nuclear Free Zone +5 = -5, summed by the ordinance simulator; the scripted host returns the sum), read on OrdinanceUpdated and again in state 14, and added to every block average before the decay: old 0, average 10 -> new 5 -> ceil(5 x 0.100000024) = 1; old -128 -> 5; old 10 -> new 5 -> floor(-0.5) = -1 -> 9; -125 - 5 clamps to -127. Hand-derived.",
